# The public key of the CodePad release signature (ECDSA, curve P-256, SubjectPublicKeyInfo PEM).
#
# This file has no key yet. A build without a key cannot verify an update, so it installs none.
# The owner of the project makes the key pair and puts the public half here before the first release.
# The private key never goes into the repository. See docs/updates.md, "Release signing".
